1. Commit under Mittansh Bhatia only (never secrets / `.env.local`).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push -u origin HEAD` when tracking is missing).
3. Remote: `https://github.com/mittanshbhatia/bayareaclubs`

Do not wait to be asked again to push routine completed work unless the user explicitly says not to push.
